  (text "FROM THE HAND-WRITTEN NETLIST THIS SHEET REPLACES (verbatim; the part notes are on each part's Note field):\n\nAUTHORITATIVE for connectivity. There is no drawing of this circuit anywhere in the corpus - two parts and one\nseries path - so this file is the first statement of it that a tool can read.\n\n[AGND_MOD] WHICH GROUND IT LANDS ON IS THE DISPUTED FIGURE. The page says so: the rail it comes from is the\nanalog one, and dig-gnd-topology owns where analog and digital returns meet. AGND_MOD is the reading that\nmatches the rail; if the figure settles the other way this line moves with it." (at 154.94 38.099999999999994 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cfa9face-4d19-5b26-a1b0-3f027f67247d))
